{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649120/extras/4e1bb9f4a806cce48b79b9a8ffeefe0f.poster.avif?t=1768218703\" width=1170 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649120/extras/4e1bb9f4a806cce48b79b9a8ffeefe0f.webm?t=1768218703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649120/extras/4e1bb9f4a806cce48b79b9a8ffeefe0f.mp4?t=1768218703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>PLASMA GUNS?</strong> Of course! Sometimes, the only way to deal with a problem is to pew pew pew it until it stops moving. <strong> </strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>COMPANION:\u00a0</strong>Your only companion is the sardonic AI, <strong>Bob</strong>, who is more a sarcastic spectator than a helpful guide.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>BUILD AND PERSONALIZE YOUR OWN HOME:</strong> Design your dream home in any style you like. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>TAKE YOUR HOUSE WITH YOU:</strong> Shrink your home to a manageable size using your plasma and carry it with you wherever you go. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>RESOURCE GATHERING WITH LASERS:</strong> Utilize your Multi-Tool's versatile lasers to gather resources from the environment with precision and efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>TAMING </strong> It's not your typical <i>&quot;befriend the wild animals&quot;</i> scenario. More like <i><strong>&quot;capture a baby animal, levitate it, and &quot;gently&quot; persuade it to be your loyal companion.&quot;</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>EXPLORE AN EXPANSIVE HANDCRAFTED WORLD:</strong> Discover hidden secrets, unearth ancient ruins, and unravel the planet mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLASMA WEATHER THREAT:</strong> Survive the planet's volatile atmosphere, dominated by unpredictable <strong>Plasma Storms</strong> that surge across the landscape.  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOURSELF A HOME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct a sturdy base to call your own, providing shelter from the elements and a place to store your belongings. Design your home however you see fit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take your home with you wherever you go</strong>, transforming any location into a personalized haven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649120/extras/3a7a5e4cc9feac0d6fc42e1fb7728976.poster.avif?t=1768218703\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649120/extras/3a7a5e4cc9feac0d6fc42e1fb7728976.webm?t=1768218703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649120/extras/3a7a5e4cc9feac0d6fc42e1fb7728976.mp4?t=1768218703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE A VAST OPEN WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the heart of this alien wilderness, where diverse biomes await your discovery. From lush forests teeming with life to beautiful beaches harboring hidden secrets, each corner of Wildsite holds its unique challenges and rewards.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you'll discover hidden caves, ancient ruins, and forgotten settlements, each filled with its own unique story to tell. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649120/extras/ac60e6c2d1eefe84fbd29120564347b8.poster.avif?t=1768218703\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649120/extras/ac60e6c2d1eefe84fbd29120564347b8.webm?t=1768218703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649120/extras/ac60e6c2d1eefe84fbd29120564347b8.mp4?t=1768218703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFT ESSENTIAL TOOLS AND WEAPONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the resources to craft tools and weapons that will be your lifeline in this unforgiving environment. Mine precious metals, gather wood and stone, and utilize your ingenuity to craft everything from makeshift tools to sophisticated weapons. With each crafted item, you strengthen your ability to survive and thrive in the wilderness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649120/extras/f1d6a0ca68dfd4d087455866d4d86c12.poster.avif?t=1768218703\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649120/extras/f1d6a0ca68dfd4d087455866d4d86c12.webm?t=1768218703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649120/extras/f1d6a0ca68dfd4d087455866d4d86c12.mp4?t=1768218703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HUNT FOR SUSTENANCE AND GATHER RESOURCES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the wilderness to hunt for food and gather resources that will keep you alive. Face the dangers of the fauna, from ferocious predators to cunning creatures. Cook your kills over a campfire to satisfy your hunger and keep your body fueled. Utilize your survival skills to gather the resources you need to build your base, craft tools, and maintain your health.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649120/extras/e4aeb5d6494218613a9c7b9f78baf07e.poster.avif?t=1768218703\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649120/extras/e4aeb5d6494218613a9c7b9f78baf07e.webm?t=1768218703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649120/extras/e4aeb5d6494218613a9c7b9f78baf07e.mp4?t=1768218703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLASMA WEATHER THREAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These high-energy events trigger lethal spikes in ambient <strong>radiation levels</strong>, forcing you to find immediate shelter or utilize synthesized suppression agents to prevent catastrophic cellular damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649120/extras/3757b3f485234589e3867c2d8e438325.poster.avif?t=1768218703\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649120/extras/3757b3f485234589e3867c2d8e438325.webm?t=1768218703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649120/extras/3757b3f485234589e3867c2d8e438325.mp4?t=1768218703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BOB THE AI COMPANION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speaking of Bob, he's basically a sarcastic love child of Bender, Roger, and Rick, constantly reminding you of your &quot;skills&quot; and questioning your every move. Think of him as your personal (and slightly judgmental) survival coach. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649120/extras/e375357cd7ecc73da4553ed2aa4cc561.poster.avif?t=1768218703\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649120/extras/e375357cd7ecc73da4553ed2aa4cc561.webm?t=1768218703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649120/extras/e375357cd7ecc73da4553ed2aa4cc561.mp4?t=1768218703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No two playthroughs will be the same,</strong> as the world of Wildsite is constantly evolving, with new challenges and rewards waiting to be discovered.  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2649120?t=1768218703","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649120/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768218703","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649120/ba5d6c046d934eccea6b3e0a479dc9cdcd773839/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768218703","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649120/ba5d6c046d934eccea6b3e0a479dc9cdcd773839/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768218703","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},